{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b1f4c2a0-9d3e-4f7a-8c12-6e5d4a3b2c10",
    "name": "Gestión Deportiva API",
    "description": "Colección para el backend Laravel 12 de Gestión Deportiva.\n\nFLOW RECOMENDADO:\n1) Ejecutar 'Auth > Login' (usa admin@club.test / password). El test guarda el token automáticamente en la variable 'token'.\n2) Ejecutar 'Deportistas > Listar' y 'Modalidades > Listar': sus tests guardan los primeros ID en 'deportistaId' y 'modalidadId'.\n3) Ya podés usar el resto de los endpoints privados.\n\nRequisito: Laragon con MySQL corriendo, migraciones ejecutadas y 'php artisan serve' en el puerto 8000.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Registro, login y recuperación de contraseña. El login guarda el token Bearer en la variable 'token'.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Usuario Prueba\",\n  \"email\": \"usuario@club.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["register"]
            },
            "description": "Crea un usuario y devuelve user + token."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token guardado');",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Login con el usuario del seeder. Guarda el token en la variable 'token'."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token guardado');",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["forgot-password"]
            },
            "description": "Envía el enlace de reseteo (MAIL_MAILER=log, revisá storage/logs/laravel.log)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"TOKEN_DEL_LOG\",\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"nuevapassword\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"nuevapassword\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["reset-password"]
            },
            "description": "Restablece la contraseña usando el token del enlace."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
